### Inventory Microservice API - Sample Requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or IntelliJ HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ========================================
### ITEM CATALOG API (Find Item Codes)
### ========================================

### Get All Items Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock/catalog
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Items by Name - MacBook
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock/catalog/search?q=macbook
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Items by Name - Galaxy
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock/catalog/search?q=galaxy
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Items by Name - Dell
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock/catalog/search?q=dell
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Items by Name - iPhone
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock/catalog/search?q=iphone
Accept: application/json

### ========================================
### STOCK CHECK SCENARIOS
### ========================================

### MacBook Pro at Colombo - IN_STOCK (10 units @ 600,000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=MACBOOK-PRO-001&branchId=BRANCH-COL
Accept: application/json

###

### MacBook Air at Colombo - OUT_OF_STOCK (0 units)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=MACBOOK-AIR-001&branchId=BRANCH-COL
Accept: application/json

###

### MacBook Air at Gampaha - IN_STOCK (15 units @ 450,000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=MACBOOK-AIR-001&branchId=BRANCH-GAM
Accept: application/json

###

### MacBook Neo at Colombo - IN_STOCK (20 units @ 350,000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=MACBOOK-NEO-001&branchId=BRANCH-COL
Accept: application/json

### ========================================
### MULTI-BRANCH PRICE COMPARISON
### ========================================

### Galaxy S24 at Colombo (360,000) vs Jaffna (320,000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=GALAXY-S24-001&branchId=BRANCH-COL
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=GALAXY-S24-001&branchId=BRANCH-JAF
Accept: application/json

###

### Dell XPS at Gampaha (280,000) vs Kandy (310,000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=DELL-XPS-001&branchId=BRANCH-GAM
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=DELL-XPS-001&branchId=BRANCH-KDY
Accept: application/json

###

### iPhone 15 Pro - landed-cost flip: Jaffna cheaper sticker (340,000), Colombo local (350,000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=IPHONE-15-001&branchId=BRANCH-JAF
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=IPHONE-15-001&branchId=BRANCH-COL
Accept: application/json

###

### Check stock for non-existent item (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=NO-SUCH-ITEM&branchId=BRANCH-COL
Accept: application/json

###

### Check stock with missing parameter (should return 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock?itemId=MACBOOK-PRO-001
Accept: application/json

### ========================================
### PRODUCTION ORDER ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Create production order - success (within available stock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "itemId": "MACBOOK-NEO-001",
    "branchId": "BRANCH-COL",
    "requestedQuantity": 5,
    "reason": "Order ORD-1001 - allocate stock"
}

###

### Create production order - insufficient stock (409): Colombo has only 10 MacBook Pro
POST {{baseUrl}}/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "itemId": "MACBOOK-PRO-001",
    "branchId": "BRANCH-COL",
    "requestedQuantity": 15,
    "reason": "Bulk order"
}

###

### Create production order without reason (reason is optional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "itemId": "MACBOOK-NEO-001",
    "branchId": "BRANCH-COL",
    "requestedQuantity": 2
}

###

### Create production order - missing itemId (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "branchId": "BRANCH-COL",
    "requestedQuantity": 5
}

###

### Create production order - negative quantity (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "itemId": "MACBOOK-NEO-001",
    "branchId": "BRANCH-COL",
    "requestedQuantity": -10,
    "reason": "Invalid quantity test"
}

### ========================================
### ACTUATOR ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Application info
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

###

### Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json
